{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17106340","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17106340","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1710634001:1":{"text":"おや、なんだいこれは……グローブ？","source_cn":"咦，这是什么？是手套吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFDC7826C2011CD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710634002:1":{"text":"これは、鷹匠（たかじょう）が使う、専用のグローブです。猟鷹はここに止まるんですよ。ほら、裏側が鷹の爪で引っ掻かれて、傷んでいるでしょう。","source_cn":"这是驯鹰人专用的手套，猎鹰会在上面停留，你看，它的背面...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58DD5979F9BE99F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710634003:1":{"text":"鷹匠のグローブと周りに散らばった羽根……おそらく、あの塔で鷹が飼われているのでしょう。","source_cn":"驯鹰手套出现在这里，结合周围的羽毛痕迹……这样看来，前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CD91B99C19DBB83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710634004:1":{"text":"うーん、鞘がいちばん強く反応してるのも、あの方角だ。もしかして、私の当てずっぽうが当たってたりして？","source_cn":"呃，前方刚好也是剑鞘感应最强的地方！不会真被我说中了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF65EA6453C844F9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小狐狸":{"text":"キツネ","source":"小狐狸","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"グウィネス","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}